  "prefLabel": "Ins 2001.18 Compliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2001.18 Compliance. Any violations of these rules by a medical utilization review entity shall be subject to such denial, suspension, or revocation of license or administrative fine not to exceed $1,000 per violation, as may be applicable under RSA 420-E:8.\n\nSource. #7683, eff 6-1-02; ss by #9721-A, eff 6-11-10; ss by #12545, eff 6-11-18",
